    "Safety information is based on the American Academy of Dermatology psoriasis guidelines and NICE guideline CG153 (Psoriasis: assessment and management). Medication schedules are typical examples — use what your doctor prescribed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Sicherheitshinweise basieren auf den Psoriasis-Leitlinien der American Academy of Dermatology und der NICE-Leitlinie CG153 (Psoriasis: assessment and management). Medikamentenpläne sind typische Beispiele – halte dich an das, was dir verschrieben wurde."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "As informações de segurança se baseiam nas diretrizes de psoríase da American Academy of Dermatology e na diretriz NICE CG153 (Psoriasis: assessment and management). As rotinas de medicamentos são exemplos típicos — use o que seu médico receitou."
          }
        },
        "es-419" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La información de seguridad se basa en las guías de psoriasis de la American Academy of Dermatology y la guía NICE CG153 (Psoriasis: assessment and management). Los esquemas de medicamentos son ejemplos típicos: usa lo que te recetó tu médico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Salicylic acid ointment" : {
